     "username": "GoodTimeData",
     "avatar_path": "/y5hX86OT2IOUtVprhRznWXZuUYL.png",
     "rating": 10
    },
    "content": "Such a great anime; if you're not into anime, Death Note is a welcome mat, a hello, and a welcome to the best of anime. A great intellect battle in a TV show and  delivering a compelling story deep and dark and one of the most philosophically dense manga ever written. It's a genuine philosophical argument about power, justice, and human nature.",
